alling in love with each other.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"1138","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1324","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"1324","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"44275","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"120061","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"89768","synopsis":"The Great War between the Angels and the Earthians is over, but Dr. Ashino still lives. While Chihaya and Kagetsuya, are in the midst of rescuing two young angels from the doctor's horrific laboratory, they stumble upon Messiah. Messiah, a genetically engineered destroyer in the form of a beautiful young angel, only has eyes for sweet Chihaya.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/120061/1204201.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"The Great War between the Angels and the Earthians is over, but Dr. Ashino still lives. While Chihaya and Kagetsuya, are in the midst of rescuing two young angels from the doctor's horrific laboratory, they stumble upon Messiah. Messiah, a genetically engineered destroyer in the form of a beautiful young angel, only has eyes for sweet Chihaya.","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"},"tvdb":{"title":"Angelic Destroyer","synopsis":"The Great War between the Angels and the Earthians is over, but Dr. Ashino still lives. While Chihaya and Kagetsuya, are in the midst of rescuing two young angels from the doctor's horrific laboratory, they stumble upon Messiah. Messiah, a genetically engineered destroyer in the form of a beautiful young angel, only has eyes for sweet Chihaya. In this episode two men are gonna make love in the bed, but one of them just isn't in the mood for it.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"